This file used to say the terms were "in the repository root (../LICENSE)".
Inside the release download there is no parent directory, so a person who
unzipped it, opened this file and went looking was sent to a file they had never
been given. A licence a reader cannot reach is not a licence they can obey.

In plain words, and the text below governs: you may use, copy, modify and
redistribute this for research and for education, and for nothing else without
written permission. Until 2026-09-15 this directory was offered under the MIT
License, and a copy obtained under that licence before that date keeps it.

Copyright (c) 2026 Treston Malachi Cuzzort.

