Version 1.1, 2026-09-18

Copyright (c) 2026 Treston Malachi Cuzzort. All rights reserved except as
granted below.

1. Definitions

"Work" means the contents of this repository authored by the copyright
holder: the t language, its translations to each verifier, the verifier
adapters, the lifter, the instruments, the tables and the documents; the tup
build driver, its overrides, receipts and release scripts; the forge and
locallm code; and every other original file in this repository. The Work also
includes what this repository produces and records: the generated task
corpora, the twins and their witnesses, the grading tables, the training sets
and preference pairs under t/runs/ and t/out/, and the model weights built
from them.

"Third-Party Material" means anything in this repository, or produced by it,
that is not the copyright holder's: the problem corpora under nl/ and their
upstream sources, DafnyBench, the source packages tup builds from, the
software inside a built tup image, the seven verifiers, and the packages
pulled in by the editor extension. Each keeps its own license, and nothing in
this license changes its terms.

"Research Use" means use whose purpose is research or education: studying,
evaluating, reproducing, extending or teaching the Work, and publishing the
results, whether by an individual, a school, a laboratory or a company's
research group, provided that the use is not part of a product, service or
offering that is sold, licensed or otherwise provided commercially, and that
neither the Work nor a derivative of it is deployed in production or used to
deliver anything to customers.

